IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-EDGE-SURVEY.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DIMENSION           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 SPARSITY-PCT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 TOPS-W-X10          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 PARAM-EFF-X100      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-EDGE-SURVEY.
    IF DIMENSION == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF SPARSITY-PCT == 0
        MOVE 40 TO SPARSITY-PCT.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE TOPS-W-X10 = (145 * (100 + (SPARSITY-PCT * 5 / 10))) / 100.
    COMPUTE PARAM-EFF-X100 = 10000 / (100 - (SPARSITY-PCT * 75 / 100)).

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 TOPS-W-X10.
    WEIGHT 30 PARAM-EFF-X100.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
